{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"1f013f6426b27f8cb555c22229b6c039f0c3bf25e128f377b49ae37cdbaeeacb","digest":{"component_or_area":"Jira reconcile bridge comment sync","key_entities":["RECONCILER_MARKER","comment_ids","outbound_comments._normalize_comment_body","_TRUNCATION_SUFFIX","adapters/jira/comment_limits.py","irongrey-chubby-oxpecker","bd80-0603-7d44-4d9f","REB-1861","712020:6471376f-4e5e-4ed2-8c05-330827bc387e","cleanup.py",".github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml"],"problem_keywords":["duplicate comments","jira reconciliation","bot-authored duplicates","comment deduplication","outbound comment sync"],"propositions":["The outbound comment sync posted duplicate comments to Jira on every hourly reconciliation pass due to an inert PRIMARY dedup map (comment_ids empty), leaving only a lossy body-membership fallback as the dedup filter.","REB-1861 reached Jira's 5000-comment hard cap, blocking new comments with COMMENTS_PER_ISSUE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED; 30 issues accumulated 31,683 total comments with 30,847 bot-marked duplicates requiring deletion.","Phase 1 cleanup deleted 29,931 duplicate bot-authored comments (keep-oldest-per-distinct-normalized-body rule) across 27 issues by detecting the RECONCILER_MARKER on pre-strip rendered ADF text; REB-1861 reduced from 5000 to 79 comments and all affected issues now hold exactly one copy per distinct body.","Three issues (REB-1567, REB-1931, REB-2605) contain 836 unmarked comments authored by the same bot, each with rendered text ending in _TRUNCATION_SUFFIX (outbound truncation at 32767 chars removed the marker paragraph); these were excluded from phase 1 and reserved for phase 2 behind --include-truncated pending operator decision.","The reconcile-bridge workflow was kept PAUSED throughout the operation and was not re-enabled; pre-deletion backups (150MB) were taken for all 27 affected issues and independent verification confirmed zero missing distinct bodies and unchanged non-candidate comment counts."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787553212707542001,"uuid":"b24e4c6c-d0e9-44e9-8b5a-e6f962b7089c"}